{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "油价势 · 后端 API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "油价势小程序的自建后端接口（Node + Express + PostgreSQL）。\n\n## 统一响应外壳\n\n所有接口都返回同一个外壳：\n\n```json\n{ \"ok\": true,  \"data\": { } }\n{ \"ok\": false, \"message\": \"错误说明\", \"code\": \"错误码\" }\n```\n\n`ok: false` 时 HTTP 状态码**仍是 200**（业务错误），只有鉴权失败才返回 401。\n小程序端 `utils/cloud.js` 按这个约定解析：`ok === false` 会 reject 并回落到本地演示源。\n\n## 认证\n\n查询类接口（`/api/regions`、`/api/home` 等）**不需要登录**。\n\n用户类接口（`/api/rules`、`/api/history`）需要登录态：\n\n1. 小程序 `wx.login()` 拿到 `code`，POST 到 `/api/login`\n2. 拿到 `token`，后续请求带 `Authorization: Bearer <token>`\n3. token 有效期 7 天；返回 401 时重新走一次登录\n\n## 错误码\n\n| code | 含义 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `NO_CODE` | 请求没带 code |\n| `UNAUTHORIZED` | 没带 token 或 token 无效/过期 |\n| `NO_OPENID` | 换不到 openid |\n| `UNKNOWN_ACTION` | 未知 action（仅云函数路径） |\n| `INTERNAL_ERROR` | 服务端异常 |\n| `NOT_FOUND` | 路径不存在 |\n\n## 数据来源\n\n返回的 `source` 字段如实标注数据来源：`mode` 为 `server` 表示来自本服务，\n`demo` 表示小程序本地演示源。`note` 是给用户看的说明。\n\n## 日期与数字格式\n\n- 日期（`date` / `executeAt` / `changeAt`）：`YYYY-MM-DD` 字符串\n- 时间戳（`publishedAt` / `updatedAt` / `time`）：ISO 8601 字符串\n- 价格与幅度：JSON number，单位元/升\n- 油品 id（`fuelId` / `id`）：**字符串**，取值 `92` / `95` / `98` / `0`\n- 地区 code：`440000` 这类 6 位行政区划码"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:3002",
      "description": "本地开发（server/npm start）"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.example.com",
      "description": "生产环境（换成你自己的已备案域名）"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "健康检查",
      "description": "部署探活"
    },
    {
      "name": "认证",
      "description": "登录与 token"
    },
    {
      "name": "油价数据",
      "description": "地区、首页、走势、调价通知"
    },
    {
      "name": "定位",
      "description": "经纬度换算省份"
    },
    {
      "name": "国际行情",
      "description": "Brent / WTI"
    },
    {
      "name": "同步状态",
      "description": "采集运行状态"
    },
    {
      "name": "提醒",
      "description": "提醒规则与记录（需登录）"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "健康检查"
        ],
        "summary": "健康检查",
        "description": "部署后探活用。返回 200 说明服务活着。",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "服务正常",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "ok": true,
                  "data": {
                    "status": "up",
                    "time": "2026-11-12T07:20:12.646Z"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/login": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "认证"
        ],
        "summary": "登录（code 换 token）",
        "description": "小程序 `wx.login()` 拿到 code 后调这个接口。\n服务端用 code 换 openid（code2session），并签发一个自签 token。\n\n**code 5 分钟有效且只能用一次**，失败后要重新 `wx.login()`。",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "code"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "code": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "wx.login() 返回的临时凭证",
                    "example": "0a3xY7K9mQ2pL8vR1sT4uW6yZ"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "登录结果（失败时 ok 为 false）",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LoginResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "success": {
                    "summary": "成功",
                    "value": {
                      "ok": true,
                      "data": {
                        "token": "eyJvcGVuaWQiOiJvcGVuaWQtdGVzdCJ9.abc123",
                        "openid": "oXyZ1234567890abcdef"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "noCode": {
                    "summary": "没带 code",
                    "value": {
                      "ok": false,
                      "message": "缺少 code",
                      "code": "NO_CODE"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/regions": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "油价数据"
        ],
        "summary": "地区列表",
        "description": "返回所有支持地区的列表，带 92# 当前价。首页和地区选择弹层用。",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "地区列表",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RegionsResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/locate": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "定位"
        ],
        "summary": "经纬度定位省份",
        "description": "把经纬度换算成省份行政区划码，小程序用它自动切到当地油价。\n\n坐标系是 **GCJ-02**，与 `wx.getLocation` 的 `type: 'gcj02'` 一致。传 WGS84 会有几百米偏移，边界省份会判错。\n\n省界数据内置在服务端（`server/src/data/provinces.json`），不依赖第三方逆地理编码服务，也没有配额限制。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "lat",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "description": "纬度（GCJ-02）",
            "schema": {
              "type": "number",
              "example": 23.129112
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "lng",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "description": "经度（GCJ-02）",
            "schema": {
              "type": "number",
              "example": 113.264385
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "定位结果。参数缺失或不在国内时 regionCode 为 null、match 为 none",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LocateResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/home": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "油价数据"
        ],
        "summary": "首页数据",
        "description": "一次给全首页要的：各油品当前价、下一轮调价窗口、近 30 天走势、最新调价通知。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "regionCode",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "地区 code，不传用默认（广东·广州 440000）",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "440000",
              "example": "440000"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "首页数据",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HomeResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/trend": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "油价数据"
        ],
        "summary": "价格走势",
        "description": "指定油品与周期的阶梯线数据 + 区间内的调价节点。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "regionCode",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "地区 code",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "440000"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "fuelId",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "油品 id",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "92",
              "enum": [
                "92",
                "95",
                "98",
                "0"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "period",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "时间范围",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "3m",
              "enum": [
                "3m",
                "6m",
                "1y"
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "走势数据",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TrendResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/notices": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "油价数据"
        ],
        "summary": "调价通知列表",
        "description": "只返回 `reviewStatus = approved` 的通知 —— 采集解析出来的可信结果才对外发布，存疑的不发布。\n同时带上下一次调价窗口与采集同步状态。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "regionCode",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "地区 code",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "440000"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "filter",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "通知类型筛选",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "official",
              "enum": [
                "official",
                "forecast"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "fuelId",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "油品 id",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "92"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "skip",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "跳过的条数（分页用）",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 0,
              "minimum": 0
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "通知列表",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NoticesResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/market": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "国际行情"
        ],
        "summary": "国际原油行情",
        "description": "Brent / WTI 的分时曲线与当日行情。曲线按 period 裁剪，不是原样回显。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "symbol",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "品种",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "brent",
              "enum": [
                "brent",
                "wti"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "period",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "周期",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "1d",
              "enum": [
                "1d",
                "1w",
                "1m",
                "3m"
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "行情数据",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MarketResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/sync-status": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "同步状态"
        ],
        "summary": "采集同步状态",
        "description": "最近一次采集的结果。`status` 的取值决定页面顶部那行文案。",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "同步状态",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SyncStatusResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/rules": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "提醒"
        ],
        "summary": "读取提醒规则",
        "description": "返回当前用户（token 里的 openid）的全部提醒规则。",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "规则列表",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RulesResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未登录或 token 失效",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "ok": false,
                  "message": "未登录或登录态已过期",
                  "code": "UNAUTHORIZED"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "提醒"
        ],
        "summary": "保存提醒规则",
        "description": "按 (地区, 油品) upsert —— 传了就更新，没传就新增，不用先查再判断。",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "rules"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "rules": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "description": "规则数组",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AlertRuleInput"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "保存结果",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RulesResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未登录或 token 失效",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/history": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "提醒"
        ],
        "summary": "读取提醒记录",
        "description": "返回当前用户最近的提醒记录，最多 50 条。",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "记录列表",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HistoryResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未登录或 token 失效",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "提醒"
        ],
        "summary": "保存提醒记录",
        "description": "写入本地产生的提醒记录。不传 dedupKey 时服务端会自己生成一个。",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "history"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "history": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "description": "记录数组",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AlertHistoryInput"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "保存结果",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HistoryResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未登录或 token 失效",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "登录接口返回的 token，格式 `Bearer <token>`"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "LocateResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": true
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "regionCode": {
                "type": "string",
                "nullable": true,
                "description": "行政区划码，未匹配到时为 null",
                "example": "440000"
              },
              "regionName": {
                "type": "string",
                "nullable": true,
                "description": "省份简称，未匹配到时为 null",
                "example": "广东"
              },
              "city": {
                "type": "string",
                "nullable": true,
                "description": "省会，未匹配到时为 null",
                "example": "广州"
              },
              "match": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "inside",
                  "nearest",
                  "none"
                ],
                "description": "inside = 落在省界内；nearest = 在省界外 25 公里内就近归属；none = 没匹配到",
                "example": "inside"
              },
              "distanceKm": {
                "type": "number",
                "nullable": true,
                "description": "距该省界的距离（公里），落在省内时为 0",
                "example": 0
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "SourceInfo": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "数据来源标注",
        "properties": {
          "mode": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "server = 来自本服务；demo = 小程序本地演示源",
            "example": "server"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "来源名称",
            "example": "服务端定时采集"
          },
          "note": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "给用户看的说明",
            "example": "数据来自服务端采集的官方公告"
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "ok",
          "message",
          "code"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": false
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "未登录或登录态已过期"
          },
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "UNAUTHORIZED"
          }
        }
      },
      "HealthResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": true
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "up"
              },
              "time": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "LoginResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": true
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "token": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "自签 token，有效期 7 天"
              },
              "openid": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "用户标识"
              }
            }
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "code": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "Region": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "行政区划码",
            "example": "440000"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "广东"
          },
          "city": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "广州"
          },
          "fullName": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "广东 · 广州"
          },
          "price92": {
            "type": "number",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "92# 当前价（元/升），该地区无数据时为 null",
            "example": 7.36
          }
        }
      },
      "RegionsResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": true
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "regions": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Region"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "PriceItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "油品 id（字符串）",
            "example": "92"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "92# 汽油"
          },
          "short": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "92#"
          },
          "unit": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "元/升"
          },
          "price": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "当前价",
            "example": 7.36
          },
          "changeAmount": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "最近一次调价幅度，负数是下调",
            "example": -0.08
          },
          "changeAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "最近一次调价日期 YYYY-MM-DD",
            "example": "2026-11-04"
          },
          "direction": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "涨跌方向",
            "enum": [
              "up",
              "down",
              "flat"
            ],
            "example": "down"
          }
        }
      },
      "Window": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "下一轮调价窗口",
        "properties": {
          "date": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "调价日期 YYYY-MM-DD",
            "example": "2026-11-14"
          },
          "time": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "24:00"
          },
          "daysLeft": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "还剩几天",
            "example": 2
          },
          "cycleStart": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "本轮周期开始日 YYYY-MM-DD",
            "example": "2026-11-14"
          },
          "cycleStarted": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "周期是否已开始",
            "example": false
          },
          "progress": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "周期进度百分比 0~100",
            "example": 0
          },
          "isOfficial": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "是否官方公布",
            "example": false
          },
          "basis": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "依据说明",
            "example": "按 10 个工作日调价周期推算"
          },
          "forecast": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "预测数据（非官方）。只有区间，没有分油品幅度 —— 来源只给整体幅度区间，复制给四个油品等于替来源猜数",
            "properties": {
              "direction": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "up",
                  "down",
                  "flat"
                ],
                "description": "预测方向",
                "example": "down"
              },
              "literMin": {
                "type": "number",
                "description": "区间下限（元/升，正数）",
                "example": 0.08
              },
              "literMax": {
                "type": "number",
                "description": "区间上限（元/升，正数）",
                "example": 0.1
              },
              "estimated": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "true 表示这是估算区间，不是官方幅度",
                "example": true
              }
            },
            "additionalProperties": true
          },
          "forecastDirection": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "预测方向；幅度解析不出来时靠它表达方向（前端显示「预计上调 · 幅度待公布」）",
            "enum": [
              "up",
              "down",
              "flat"
            ],
            "example": "down"
          }
        }
      },
      "NoticeItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "通知 id",
            "example": 1
          },
          "kind": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "official = 官方正式；forecast = 市场预测",
            "enum": [
              "official",
              "forecast"
            ],
            "example": "official"
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "国内成品油价格按机制上调"
          },
          "publishedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "发布时间 ISO 8601",
            "example": "2026-11-12T07:20:12.610Z"
          },
          "executeAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "执行日期 YYYY-MM-DD",
            "example": "2026-11-12"
          },
          "changes": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "各油品调整幅度（元/升），负数是下调",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "example": {
              "0": 0.15,
              "92": 0.15,
              "95": 0.15,
              "98": 0.15
            }
          },
          "summary": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "各油品每升上调 0.15 元"
          },
          "prices": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "调整后各油品价格（before / after / delta）",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "before": {
                  "type": "number",
                  "example": 7.36
                },
                "after": {
                  "type": "number",
                  "example": 7.21
                },
                "delta": {
                  "type": "number",
                  "example": -0.15
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "source": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "原文来源",
            "additionalProperties": true
          }
        }
      },
      "Point": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "date": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "日期 YYYY-MM-DD（国际行情是 YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss）",
            "example": "2026-11-04"
          },
          "value": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "价格",
            "example": 7.36
          }
        }
      },
      "RegionRef": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "440000"
          },
          "fullName": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "广东 · 广州"
          }
        }
      },
      "HomeResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": true
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "region": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RegionRef"
              },
              "prices": {
                "type": "array",
                "description": "各油品当前价",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PriceItem"
                }
              },
              "window": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Window"
              },
              "trend30": {
                "type": "object",
                "description": "近 30 天走势，key 是油品 id",
                "additionalProperties": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "points": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Point"
                      }
                    },
                    "labels": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "description": "X 轴标签",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "example": [
                        "10月14日",
                        "10月29日",
                        "11月12日"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "changes": {
                "type": "object",
                "description": "最新通知里各油品的调整幅度",
                "additionalProperties": {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              },
              "notice": {
                "nullable": true,
                "description": "最新一条已复核的调价通知",
                "allOf": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NoticeItem"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "latestNotice": {
                "nullable": true,
                "description": "与 notice 同一份数据 —— 小程序端读的是这个名字，两个都给是为了不让两端字段漂移",
                "allOf": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NoticeItem"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "updatedAt": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "本地区价格的最后采集时间，没有则为空串",
                "example": "2026-11-12T07:20:12.610Z"
              },
              "publishedAt": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "最新通知的发布时间，没有则为空串",
                "example": "2026-11-12T07:20:12.610Z"
              },
              "source": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SourceInfo"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "TrendEvent": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "date": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "2026-08-26"
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "国内成品油价格按机制上调"
          },
          "amount": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "该油品的调整幅度",
            "example": 0.1
          },
          "direction": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "up",
              "down",
              "flat"
            ],
            "example": "up"
          },
          "priceAfter": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "调价当天的价格",
            "example": 7.36
          }
        }
      },
      "TrendResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": true
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "region": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RegionRef"
              },
              "fuel": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "92"
                  },
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "92# 汽油"
                  }
                }
              },
              "price": {
                "type": "number",
                "description": "区间末价格",
                "example": 7.36
              },
              "deltaPercent": {
                "type": "number",
                "description": "区间涨跌百分比",
                "example": -1.24
              },
              "direction": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "up",
                  "down",
                  "flat"
                ],
                "example": "down"
              },
              "rangeLabel": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "近 3 个月"
              },
              "low": {
                "type": "number",
                "example": 7.28
              },
              "high": {
                "type": "number",
                "example": 7.55
              },
              "count": {
                "type": "integer",
                "description": "区间内调价节点数",
                "example": 6
              },
              "axis": {
                "type": "array",
                "description": "X 轴标签（三个）",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "example": [
                  "2026/08",
                  "2026/09",
                  "2026/11"
                ]
              },
              "points": {
                "type": "array",
                "description": "阶梯线数据点",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Point"
                }
              },
              "events": {
                "type": "array",
                "description": "区间内调价节点",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TrendEvent"
                }
              },
              "source": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SourceInfo"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "SyncInfo": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "采集状态",
            "enum": [
              "ok",
              "idle",
              "pending",
              "partial",
              "error"
            ],
            "example": "idle"
          },
          "lastCheckedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "最近检查时间 ISO 8601，没有则为空串",
            "example": ""
          },
          "sourceName": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "服务端定时采集"
          },
          "sourceUrl": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "NoticesResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": true
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "region": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RegionRef"
              },
              "window": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Window"
              },
              "sync": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SyncInfo"
              },
              "notices": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NoticeItem"
                }
              },
              "source": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SourceInfo"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "MarketResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": true
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "symbol": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "brent",
                  "wti"
                ],
                "example": "brent"
              },
              "name": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "布伦特原油"
              },
              "price": {
                "type": "number",
                "example": 78.42
              },
              "changeAmount": {
                "type": "number",
                "example": 0.64
              },
              "changePercent": {
                "type": "number",
                "example": 0.82
              },
              "direction": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "up",
                  "down",
                  "flat"
                ],
                "description": "涨跌方向，前端 trend-chart 组件的配色依据",
                "example": "up"
              },
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "品种代码",
                "example": "BRENT"
              },
              "delayMinutes": {
                "type": "number",
                "nullable": true,
                "description": "行情延时分钟数；算不出来时为 null（界面显示「延时行情」，不显示 undefined）",
                "example": 12
              },
              "open": {
                "type": "number",
                "example": 77.81
              },
              "prevClose": {
                "type": "number",
                "example": 77.78
              },
              "high": {
                "type": "number",
                "example": 78.67
              },
              "low": {
                "type": "number",
                "example": 77.56
              },
              "points": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Point"
                }
              },
              "axis": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "X 轴标签（国际行情是单个字符串，不是数组）",
                "example": "15:08"
              },
              "delayed": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "是否延时数据",
                "example": true
              },
              "quoteTime": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "11-12 15:08:12"
              },
              "source": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SourceInfo"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "SyncStatusResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": true
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "ok",
                  "idle",
                  "pending",
                  "partial",
                  "error"
                ],
                "example": "idle"
              },
              "sourceName": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "服务端定时采集"
              },
              "lastCheckedAt": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": ""
              },
              "needsReview": {
                "type": "array",
                "description": "待人工核对的采集项",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "sourceId": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "example": "ndrc-notice"
                    },
                    "reason": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "example": "PARSE_FAILED"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "example": "正文抓取成功但无法解析出结构化字段，已转人工核对"
                    },
                    "at": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "format": "date-time"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "source": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SourceInfo"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "AlertRuleInput": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "regionCode",
          "fuelId"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "regionCode": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "地区 code",
            "example": "440000"
          },
          "fuelId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "油品 id",
            "enum": [
              "92",
              "95",
              "98",
              "0"
            ],
            "example": "92"
          },
          "officialDrop": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "官方降价即提醒",
            "default": true
          },
          "targetPrice": {
            "type": "number",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "目标价（元/升），null 表示不启用",
            "example": 7.2
          },
          "forecastDrop": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "预测下调也提醒（默认关）。小程序端字段名，库里的列是 predict_drop，服务端负责翻译",
            "default": false
          },
          "targetEnabled": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "目标价提醒开关（默认开）",
            "default": true
          },
          "subscribeGranted": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "用户是否已授权订阅消息。一次授权只够发一条，发完服务端会置回 false；不传表示不改",
            "default": false
          },
          "subscribeUsedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "一次性订阅额度用掉的时间。有值说明「授权已用完」，null 表示从未授权过"
          }
        }
      },
      "AlertRule": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AlertRuleInput"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "integer",
                "example": 1
              },
              "userId": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "用户 openid"
              },
              "extra": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": true
              },
              "createdAt": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time"
              },
              "updatedAt": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "RulesResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": true
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "rules": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AlertRule"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "AlertHistoryInput": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "记录标题",
            "example": "官方降价提醒"
          },
          "time": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "发生时间，不传用当前时间"
          },
          "sent": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "是否已下发",
            "default": false
          },
          "dedupKey": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "去重键，不传服务端自己生成"
          }
        }
      },
      "AlertHistory": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AlertHistoryInput"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "integer",
                "example": 1
              },
              "userId": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "dedupKey": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "failReason": {
                "type": "string",
                "nullable": true,
                "example": null
              },
              "payload": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "HistoryResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "ok": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": true
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "history": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AlertHistory"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
